  "description": "Backend-neutral types shared by the Starlings model packages: one CapabilityStatus, the ITextEmbedder and IReranker interfaces, Reranking helpers that rerank a vector-search top-k (experimental), IModelAssets for a package's asset lock and explicit acquisition, the InputTooLongException base, and ModelProfileCapabilities, the machine-readable capability record each package generates from its registry manifests. No ONNX Runtime dependency; references only Starlings.Acquisition (BCL only). Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
